  "description": "Waterside Barn Conversion | Log Burner | Private Countryside Retreat\n\nSet within a special area of conservation along the banks of the Grand Canal and River Barrow, this beautifully restored rustic stable offers a rare opportunity to live in a truly tranquil countryside setting.\n\nThe property is a compact one-bedroom unit featuring a bright open-plan kitchen and living space, centred around a traditional log burner that creates a warm and cosy atmosphere throughout the year. The bedroom includes a modern en-suite shower room, with the overall layout thoughtfully designed in a characterful barn conversion style.\n\nSurrounded by natural beauty, the property enjoys direct access to the Barrow Blueway, making it ideal for walking, cycling, and outdoor pursuits.\n\nWith secure gated access and excellent privacy, this home offers a quiet and self-contained living environment, ideal for those seeking a peaceful retreat with access to nature.\n\nDue to the layout and setting, the property is not suited to high-occupancy use.\n\nFibre broadband and access to on-site laundry facilities are included. Electricity is charged separately.\n\nThis is a unique and special property offering privacy, comfort, and a high-quality rural lifestyle.\n\nDeposit required. Rent payable one month in advance.",
